  "Genres": "Racing",
  "Name": "Sega Rally Revo",
  "Overview": "Sega Rally Revo is an arcade-style rally racer in which licensed cars compete side by side on paved roads and loose surfaces. Tires carve ruts into soft ground as cars pass, so a racing line that worked on the first lap may handle differently later. Fifteen circuits take drivers from safari tracks to alpine and arctic terrain. Championship races unlock events and cars, while Quick Race and Time Attack offer standalone races and ghost laps. The Xbox 360 version supports local split-screen racing and originally offered online races for up to six players.",
